=== Sanese stars abroad ===
Promotions like NOPW have a long-standing tradition of sending young wrestlers on "Excursion" to [[Shayden]], [[Etrusca]], and the [[United Provinces]] to learn diverse styles. Famous examples include [[The Great Muta]]’s legendary run in Shaydian television circuits and [[Jyushin Thunder Liger]]’s appearances in the Althenian Cruiserweight championships.

Sanese wrestlers often adopt new personae abroad; many sent to Etrusca adopt the mask, while those in Shayden frequently play into the "Mystic East" or "Technocratic Mastermind" tropes. In the 2020s, stars like [[w:Shinsuke Nakamura|Nakamura]] and [[w:Asuka (wrestler)|Asuka]] have become household names in Illypnia, with the former maintaining his "Strong Style" identity while performing for major Shaydian networks.

